---
description: Enforce Spec-Driven Development for all feature work
alwaysApply: true
---

Work Spec-Driven Development (SDD) in this repo.

- Before implementing a feature or behavior change, create/update `specs/<feature>/spec.md`.
- Derive `specs/<feature>/plan.md` from the spec, then implement only what the spec requires.
- If requirements change, update the spec first, then the code.
- See `AGENTS.md` and `docs/spec-driven-development.md`.
